     "stop_timestamp": "2025-12-07T23:32:48.424000Z",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Yes, chili freezes very well. Cool it fully first, leave a little headspace in the containers, and it keeps 2–3 months. Thaw overnight in the fridge, or microwave from frozen with a splash of water, stirring halfway.",
     "citations": []
