     "stop_timestamp": "2025-12-07T23:35:49.468000Z",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Easiest options:\n- Serve over rice: 1 cup cooked adds ~200 kcal and ~45 g carbs.\n- Add a can of corn to the pot (~+15 g carbs per serving).\n- Eat with a couple of corn tortillas or a slice of cornbread.\n\nRice is the simplest for meal prep: cook a batch and pack it separately so it doesn't go mushy.",
